comment
a write a comment    ↓/j  down         ctrl+d half page down    1-9   saved query           ctrl+k commands
e edit this one      ↑/k  up           ctrl+u half page up      g 1-9 switch view           ?      help
d delete this one    pgdn page down    g g    oldest            esc   back                  q      quit
                     pgup page up      G      newest            r     refresh
                                       ←/h    pan left          R     refetch everything
                                       →/l    pan right

filter
enter choose what to filter by    ↓/j  down         1-9   saved query           ctrl+k commands
                                  ↑/k  up           g 1-9 switch view           ?      help
                                  pgdn page down    esc   back                  q      quit
                                  pgup page up      r     refresh
                                  home first row    R     refetch everything
                                  end  last row

form
enter use this issue type    ↓/j  down         1-9   saved query           ctrl+k commands
                             ↑/k  up           g 1-9 switch view           ?      help
                             home first row    esc   back                  q      quit
                             end  last row     r     refresh
                                               R     refetch everything

issue
tab next pane        ↓/j    down         d/ctrl+d  half page down        1-9   saved query           ctrl+k commands
e   edit fields      ↑/k    up           u/ctrl+u  half page up          g 1-9 switch view           ?      help
t   change status    f/pgdn page down    g g       top                   esc   back                  q      quit
C   comment          b/pgup page up      G         bottom                r     refresh
                     →/l    pan right    shift+tab previous pane         R     refetch everything
                     ←/h    pan left     z         expand or collapse
                                         <         wider sidebar
                                         >         wider description
                                         =         reset the split

issue.edit
enter  change this field    ↓/j down    ←/h previous value    1-9   saved query           ctrl+k commands
del    empty this field     ↑/k up      →/l next value        g 1-9 switch view           ?      help
ctrl+s save                                                   esc   back                  q      quit
X      discard changes                                        r     refresh
                                                              R     refetch everything

issue.move
enter choose    ↓/j down    1-9   saved query           ctrl+k commands
                ↑/k up      g 1-9 switch view           ?      help
                            esc   back                  q      quit
                            r     refresh
                            R     refetch everything

list
enter open                                     ↓/j  down         ctrl+d half page down    1-9   saved query        ...
f     filter by a person, a status, a label    ↑/k  up           ctrl+u half page up      g 1-9 switch view
/     filter                                   pgdn page down    g g    first row         esc   back
a     all issues                               pgup page up      G      last row          r     refresh
e     edit this search                                                                    R     refetch everything
s     save this query to a key

